docs/research/
docs/superpowers/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/ — everything here is fetched or generated
#
# Stores (*.xlsx), exports (*.dta, *.scp, *.lst) and the raw archive are all
# reproducible with `callsigns harvest` / `callsigns export`, and the tree runs
# to hundreds of megabytes. Two files are deliberately kept: the vendored
# continent table, which the .lst exporter needs at runtime, and the README
# that documents the directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
!data/README.md
!data/continents.json

# Atomic-save temp files, wherever they land.
*.tmp
